 Limited] split off from Junior Recordings Ltd. in 1998, the Junior Boy's Own label was mostly dormant, aside from licensing out older recordings.  Pete Heller and Terry Farley continued on with Junior Recordings Ltd., issuing new releases on the Junior Records/[l=Junior London] label, as well as co-brands and sublabels  through [l=Parlophone] and [l=Virgin Records].  After [l=JBO] ceased operations in 2004, Junior Recordings Ltd. revived the Junior Boy's Own label and began releasing new and legacy material on it again.\r\n\r\nName variations: \r\n- Junior Boy's Own \r\n- Junior Boys Own","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:label:283","relations":{"parentLabel":{"id":680176,"name":"Boy's Own Productions"},"sublabels":[{"id":98148,"name":"Collect Boy's Own"},{"id":2610,"name":"Jus' Trax"}]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/label/283-Junior-Boys-Own","type":"label","urls":["http://www.boysownproductions.com","http://www.facebook.com/boysownproductions","http://www.instagram.com/boys.own","http://myspace.com/boysownproductions"]}},"/api/discogs/label/3467728/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"3467728","image":"","imageThumb":"","profile":"","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:label:3467728","relations":{"parentLabel":null,"sublabels":null},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/label/3467728-ISO-Supremacy","type":"label","urls":[]}},"/api/discogs/label/4159/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"4159","image":"https://i.discogs.com/Vw-CRIlQAw_iID1qW3r48KxLuRjLb6901sXF92mqGPc/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:522/w:600/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9MLTQxNTkt/MTQyMzY3NzUwMi0y/MTQ4LmpwZWc.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/Vm6aFQQ97oAjjG5Fg34t6cWNHpxWs_mjGCae-SJZ0vg/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9MLTQxNTkt/MTQyMzY3NzUwMi0y/MTQ4LmpwZWc.jpeg","profile":"Dutch hardcore techno/gabber sublabel from ID&T. Now defunct.\r\n\r\nA printing error on the first two releases marked them as HB001 & 